      "created_at": "2012-10-26T06:39:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>On her Incapacitated side, Nuit causes the Environment trash to be reshuffled into the Environment deck. If there is no Environment trash, do I still have to shuffle the Environment deck? The same question applies to Incapacitated Atum and the Villain deck, but obviously it should have the same answer.</p>",
