      "created_at": "2012-10-26T12:20:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There's no real reason to unless you've stacked the deck using Visionary, Nightmist, Wraith, or Tempest. A random deck will still be random whether you shuffle it again or not.</p><p>If you have stacked one or more cards (top or bottom) then yes.</p>",
