      "created_at": "2012-10-26T16:43:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I agree.&nbsp; There's no point to the physical act of shuffling if all you're going to end up with is a deck that's just as random as it is currently, but if shuffling it will increase its randomness, it needs to be shuffled.</p>",
